  m_text: 'Your Route always starts at A. Hit START to begin which starts the clock.

    Touch
    the next point to begin your route.

    Continue touching points until every
    point has been visited.

    Return to the starting point (A) to complete the
    route whch stops the clock.

    Use UNDO to remove your last selection.

    When
    finished touch SUBMIT.  After your results are displayed you can load a new puzzle
    or try the existing puzzle again.


    Try to match the shortest possible route!'
